---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Blogger & Curation Manifesto | AI Learning Log"
  description="Learn about the origin and curation philosophy of AI Learning Log. Dedicated to handpicking top-tier free AI courses worldwide."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 tracking-wider uppercase">About Blogger</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">
          AI Learning Log
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Curating the finest free AI courses so you don't pay thousands for bootcamps</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          Hello and welcome! I am Matthew, an independent tech enthusiast and developer who self-studies artificial intelligence and builds real-world AI applications.
        </p>
        <p>
          With the generative AI explosion, the internet is flooded with exorbitant $2,000 bootcamps and commercial courses promising the moon. Yet, if you look closely, the world's most capable AI organizations—<strong>OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Cloud, Stanford, and Dr. Andrew Ng</strong>—have published **world-class, high-fidelity educational courses 100% free of charge**.
        </p>
        <p>
          Unfortunately, many of these gems are scattered across obscure GitHub repositories, developer documentation hubs, or hidden cloud training portals. I created <strong>AI Learning Log</strong> with one simple mission: <strong>test, organize, and review the best free AI courses in the world so learners can level up without spending a dime.</strong>
        </p>

        <hr class="border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 my-8" />

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Our 3 Curation Standards</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Zero Hidden Paywalls</strong>: We reject courses that give two teaser videos and lock the real curriculum behind a subscription.</li>
          <li><strong>Authoritative Creators</strong>: Backed by primary AI labs, university faculty, or proven industry practitioners.</li>
          <li><strong>Executable & Practical</strong>: Focus on interactive Colab notebooks, Python SDKs, and production deployment patterns.</li>
        </ul>

        <hr class="border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 my-8" />

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Feedback & Course Submissions</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Have an outstanding free AI tutorial or open-source course you'd like to recommend? Spotted an outdated link? Reach out anytime!
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800 text-sm">
          📧 <strong>Contact Email</strong>: <a href="mailto:matthew.lee.dev7@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline font-medium">matthew.lee.dev7@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
